


##10 Questions about AI


1. What is Generative AI, and what does it do?
2. Why should a banker care about Generative AI?
3. What banking tasks can AI help us perform? 
4. What is a prompt, and why does the quality of the prompt matter?
5. What is a meta-prompt?
6. How can we write better prompts?
7. When should we use ChatGPT, Copilot, Gemini, NotebookLM, or other AI tools?
8. Can we trust everything AI generates?
9. What information should bankers never put into an unapproved AI tool?
10. Will AI take our jobs—or change how we do our jobs?

For a 10-minute presentation, these questions are much better than trying to teach colleagues all the technical details. 
The QUEEN/PARIS example, one bad-prompt vs. good-prompt banking example, and the final “AI + Human” message will be the parts they are most likely to remember.




